<title>USA: Werner Enterprises promotes executives.</title>
<headline>Werner Enterprises promotes executives.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Werner Enterprises Inc said Thursday it promoted Curtis Werner to the new position of vice chairman-development.</p>
<p>Succeeding Werner as chief operating officer is Robert Synowicki Jr, who also retains his exeuctive vice president title at the company, a truckload carrier of general commodities.</p>
<p>John Steele, who was vice president-controller and corporate secretary, remains vice president and takes on the additional titles of chief financial officer and treasurer, previously held by Synowicki.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
